# SavannaTree transfer runs.
#
# phase4/ is the FROZEN 2026-07/08 thread: only its write-up is tracked, because its
# pipeline code, Modal app, GT/split JSON, caches and figures are machine-local or
# regenerable.
#
# v2/ is the current thread and IS tracked (source, GT, calibration and results only --
# checkpoints, features and rasters stay out). The reason v2 is tracked at all is that
# phase4's blanket ignore is why nothing of that run survived on this machine.
*
!.gitignore
!phase4/
phase4/*
!phase4/README.md

!v2/
v2/*
!v2/*.py
!v2/*.md
!v2/*.sh
!v2/gt_test.json
!v2/gt_train_all.json
!v2/gt_train_polys.json
!v2/split.json
!v2/calib/
!v2/calib/*.json
!v2/results/
!v2/results/*.json
!v2/results/REGISTER.jsonl
!v2/results/GATES.md
